The claim that "5G causes COVID-19" is explicitly and thoroughly refuted by the scientific consensus and multiple health authorities worldwide. The evidence clearly demonstrates that COVID-19 is caused by a virus (SARS-CoV-2), that 5G electromagnetic radiation is non-ionizing and biologically incapable of causing or transmitting the virus, and that COVID-19 spreads in regions without any 5G infrastructure. There is no credible scientific support for this claim.

